  # Requests are counted, so an entry thinks at the highest level its model takes: the catalogue gives the
  # levels under "opencode.reasoning_options" (read 2026-11-24), and an entry sets one only where
  # "reasoning_effort", the field LiteLLM sends, is among the model's "supported_parameters" too.
